<title>USA: New Hampshire Gov vows not to raise taxes.</title>
<headline>New Hampshire Gov vows not to raise taxes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Hampshire's first female governor, Jeanne Sheheen, who was sworn in Thursday, vowed not to raise taxes and to decrease electricity rates in the state.</p>
<p>The Democrat governor said she also intends to make public kindergarten available for every child in New Hampshire.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
